==English==
[[Image:Flag of Belarus.svg|thumb|National flag|upright=1.2]]
{{wp}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|Belarus'||rare}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|sla-pro|*bělъ||white}} + ''-a-'' (connecting morpheme) + {{der|en|orv|Русь||[[Ruthenia]]}}, possibly named for the grey-white [[w:podzol |podzol]] soils of the [[w:File:Podzol_map.svg |area]]; The stem ''bel-'' is cognate with ''[[Balt-]]'' (''[[Baltic]]''), from Lithuanian {{m|lt|baltas||white}}. Compare {{cog|be|Белару́сь}}, {{cog|ru|Белару́сь}}, {{m|ru|Белору́ссия}}.

